{
  "_readme": "Which Figma component sets are the same thing as which code component. figma: names of the sets in figma/manifest.json. ignoreProps: Figma properties that are not component props in code. notMirrored: components that are deliberately not drawn in Figma, with the reason. rulesException: components allowed to hard-code colours, with the reason. propAliases: Figma property -> code prop when they are the same thing under a different name. The note field, when set, also stops the same-name check from flagging a deliberate naming difference.",
